; 60 x 30 mm = 1.80 m against 1.40 m between the plugs, so it hangs. The Saturn lead's solver
; tuning with a thicker tube: the plug's loom, 14 mm across, in the loom's black. The cord
; leaves each plug along its -Y (the loom's way out), not the default -Z.
[node name="VerletRope" type="VerletRope" parent="."]
